== Use ==

11 Carrer Balisca operates as a multi-tenant office building. The tower's large, efficient floor plates and location in the Districte Financer make it attractive to corporate tenants, including financial services firms, law offices, insurance companies, and professional services providers. The ground floor contains retail space and a lobby, while the upper floors are divided among multiple tenants.

== History ==

The tower was constructed between 1999 and 2002 as part of the second wave of Districte Financer development, following the post-crisis recovery of the Sant Cristòfor commercial property market. The building was designed as a functional, conservative office tower, intended to provide efficient floor space for corporate tenants rather than to make a dramatic architectural statement. The vertical fins and subtle changes in façade depth give the building its character without compromising its commercial practicality.

